{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56091","headline":"通玄赞八首 六 · 杜光庭","name":"通玄赞八首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我身良可惜，宜各修生道。\n孰云白玉芝，多莳黄金草。\n结志行六度，专心论三宝。\n白元来降接，赤子常携抱。\n朽年慙晚学，壮岁须及早。\n知足自逍遥，贪荣更忧恼。\n坐观环堵大，静觉乾坤小。\n守一若无移，终天岂云老。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56091.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56091","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}